<title>USA: First Data Corp Q3 shr rises to $0.72.</title>
<headline>First Data Corp Q3 shr rises to $0.72.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.72		    $0.54</p>
<p> Net			166,600		  121,900</p>
<p> Revs		   1,254,400		1,047,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 237,800		  233,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First Call Q3 consensus earnings estimates: $0.72 a share.  </p>
<p>	  9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.78		    $1.38</p>
<p> Net			412,200		  305,500</p>
<p> Revs		   3,584,500		2,962,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 237,800		  228,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Above revenues are revenues from operations. Q3 total revenues: $1.258 billion vs $1.071 billion. Nine month total revenues $3.588 billion vs $3.067 billion.</p>
<p>1995 Q3 includes a $24.1 million gain from the sale of HBO &amp; Co common stock and a charge of $17.3 million from writedown of assets, excess facility costs and severance costs.</p>
<p>1996 nine month period includes a charge of $10.0 million, or $0.04 a share from merger charges.</p>
</text>
